{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T02:20:23.188Z","ordinal":13232,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0a9cf77de2465950016acee6e7272c8199911376a3000b14c4","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Roy，Queen 这条反证也已核对：**“火炬死亡后女王缺少 +2 力量”这一初判已撤回。** 实际帧是力量 2，基准模型也已给出 2；草稿额外再加一次，反而算成了 4。\n\n玩具夹具把原招式力量设成 0，因此 **12/12 通过不能证明草稿正确**。草稿未上线、已撤回；火炬逐回合力量增长的局部缺失仍单独保留，沿原任务处理。\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a137e3-8be8-7c23-bc8f-faaa886a2012","create_time":1791944423.1592414,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0a9cf77de2465950016acee6e7272c8199911376a3000b14c4","turn_id":"01a137e3-8be8-7c23-bc8f-faaa886a2012","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a13835-f714-7282-bd8e-7d60025b55e0","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":497}}
